%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
flowchart TB
    subgraph WindowsHost[Windows 11 development host]
        subgraph LinuxOCI[Docker Desktop and WSL2 - Linux OCI]
            Web[Web]
            API[API]
            Worker[Worker]
            DB[(PostgreSQL)]
            Redis[(Redis)]
            Artifacts[(Local artifact store)]
            Traffic[Test traffic service]
        end
    end

    Agents[Authorized agents]
    User[Authorized user]

    User -->|HTTPS| Web
    Web --> API
    Agents -->|Outbound HTTPS| API
    API --> DB
    API --> Redis
    Redis --> Worker
    Worker --> DB
    Worker --> Artifacts
    Agents -->|Reserved lab traffic| Traffic
